			"othercredits"
			{
				"english"		"Vocals and lyrics by Livia Maki Yoshikawa.\r\n\r\nAll tracks except \"Chillax Afternoon\" composed by Livia Maki Yoshikawa.\r\n\r\n\"Stay With Me\" composed by Livia Maki Yoshikawa, arranged by Gustavo Oyakawa, and mixed by Kooi Kawazoe (also played the guitar).\r\n\r\n\"Chillax Afternoon\" composed by Augusto Piccinini.\r\n\r\n\"Chillax Afternoon\", \"Afternoon Gloom\", \"Shigoto ga Owaranai\", \"Polentagem da Paixão\", \"Indícios\", and \"Stay With Chameleon\" mixed by Vinicius Faina.\r\n\r\n\"E n d l e s s  W o r k\" composed by Livia Maki Yoshikawa and vaporized by Augusto Piccinini.\r\n\r\nCover art by Lívia Santos."
